%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4fafe43b89343e3a7ba1235e8987c0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 14. ClashExplaining
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Entries:
  - content: Ugh, looks like I'll have to prepare for a <i>Clash</i>.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'The first Action I play against an incoming enemy Action will form
      a <i>Clash</i>. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'During battle, these two Clashing Actions will compete against each
      other. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: They will roll their Power simultaneously...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "And the Action that rolls the higher power will win, destroying the
      opposing Action. \r\n\r\n"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: The losing Action deals <i>no</i> damage.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'So I''ll have to choose carefully which Action I play first as it will
      Clash. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'I can always change my clashing Action by clicking on its icon in the
      queue and retrieving it. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
